  "body": "Part of #3098. The maintainer requested a separate PR for the post, its golden output and its refusal tests.\n\nAdd a Camcraft post for Heidenhain Klartext. Require an exact match for iTNC 530 NC software 340490-03 and the supported installation. Support one metric setup, stock bounds, one preset, three linear axes, straight moves, plunges and constant-height XY arcs. Give a diagnostic for each unsupported input before writing an output file.\n\nDone means: The public posting path produces the expected .H file. Tests cover the supported moves, manual tool changes and refusal paths. A refused job preserves an existing output file. The PR cites the release manual and identifies which samples ran on the programming station. It lists the checks that still need the physical Picomax.\n\nRequested labels: enhancement, P6, effort:max, area:post, source:agent.\n",
